Before planning or changing anything in this repository, read `AGENTS.md`, `docs/AI_AGENT_OPERATING_MODEL.md`, `ROADMAP.md`, `MASTER_BLUEPRINT.md`, and `AI_RESTORE_PROMPT.md`. Follow the branch, task scope, safety, testing, and reporting rules in those files. Never work directly on `main`; use an isolated branch and focused PR. Do not claim tests, migrations, or deployments passed without evidence for the exact revision.